题的能力和较强的创新意识。\r\n","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"1","ChangeDate":"2021-12-29T10:00:27","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"07436816-ff77-435b-a4ba-9b8f56fd6b5c","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390429199,"PostDateInt":1640742960000,"PostDate":"2021-12-29T09:56:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"质量工程师QA&QC(常州）","OrgId":146375,"Org":"制造集团","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·常州市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.制定项目控制计划及关键控制点；\r\n2.生产过程中关键工序的质量监控；\r\n3.客诉过程中的质量沟通处理与改善信息反馈；\r\n4.对产线潜在风险进行验证，将验证结果同相关部门讨论后制定成标准化管控要求并推广运用；\r\n5.为提高产品可靠性试验效率及准确性设计及验证新的试验方法；\r\n6.测量器具、测量方法的标准化；\r\n7.分析产品失效原因及改善措施的标准化及推广，实验分析竞争对手产品性能&结构&材料找出差异点提升公司质量水平；\r\n8.完成公司领导交办的其他工作任务。","Require":"1. 本科及以上学历，材料、机械等理工科专业；\r\n2.具